        h2 Usage
        h3 Data
        markdown
            p The following data structure must exist to be able to use Quick search form template.

        +printJson({
            "data": {
                "categories": [
                    {
                        "name": "...",
                        "label": "..."
                    }
                ],
                "category": "...",
                "submissions": [
                    {
                        "doi": "...",
                        "title": "...",
                        "state": "...",
                        "category": "...",
                        "submissionDate": "..."
                    }

                ]
            }
        })

    | #{''}

    section.source_section
        h2 Example
        h3 Submission List
        .source_example
            | !{data.items[0].body}
    | #{''}